    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d389">

                <pb facs="0486" n="320" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg320"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 818.00/120</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Hale to the
                            Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">San José</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-03-29T22:00:00-05:36">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 29, 1917, 10 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>After much trouble with sundry objections to overcome including Government’s
                    contention that a diplomatic communication should not be addressed to an
                    unofficial body, ex-Presidents Gonzáles, Viguez, Esquivel, Soto, Yglesias and
                    Durán met this afternoon and after considering the information contained in
                    Department’s February 9, 3 p.m., February 17, 1 p.m., and March 15, 6 p.m.,
                    unanimously agreed to the following statement:</p>
                <p>The ex-Presidents support the present order of affairs which is upheld by the
                    will of the people and which presents the opportunity of giving to the country a
                    new constitution which shall better fulfill its political needs and
                    aspirations.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hale</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
